{%- comment -%} steps {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section bg-dark">
  <div class="wrap wrap-wide">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h-lg">Four steps. Zero effort.</h2><p>Sensors, a slow-turning sift drum and a sealed drawer do the whole job — quietly, and only when it's safe.</p></div>
    <div class="steps"><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7z"/></svg></span><h4>Your cat visits</h4><p>Precision weight sensors know the moment a cat steps in — and exactly when they leave.</p></div><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><h4>A safe pause</h4><p>WARCAT waits a few minutes, double-checks the chamber is empty, then begins.</p></div><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span><h4>Quiet sift & seal</h4><p>The drum rotates slowly, sifting clumps into a carbon-sealed drawer below — under 40 dB.</p></div><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M5 21c0-4 3-6.5 7-6.5s7 2.5 7 6.5"/></svg></span><h4>You get a ping</h4><p>The app logs the cycle and tells you when the drawer's full. Empty it weekly. Done.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

