            <button class="acc__head" type="button">Is it really quiet enough for a small apartment? <span class="pm">+</span></button>
            <div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner"><p>Yes. The cleaning cycle runs under 40 dB — quieter than a typical fridge. Most owners can't hear it from the next room, and you can schedule quiet hours so it never runs overnight.</p></div></div>
          </div><div class="acc__item" >
            <button class="acc__head" type="button">Will it work for multiple cats? <span class="pm">+</span></button>
            <div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner"><p>Absolutely — it's built for it. The 90L globe and large sealed drawer comfortably handle up to four cats, and the app tracks each cat individually by weight.</p></div></div>
          </div><div class="acc__item" >
            <button class="acc__head" type="button">What litter does it use? <span class="pm">+</span></button>
            <div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner"><p>Any quality clumping clip litter (clay or tofu/plant-based clumping). No proprietary refills, no subscriptions.</p></div></div>
          </div><div class="acc__item" >
            <button class="acc__head" type="button">Is it safe for kittens and senior cats? <span class="pm">+</span></button>
            <div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner"><p>It's safe for any cat over 1 kg. Triple sensors stop and reverse the drum instantly if a cat enters mid-cycle, and the low, wide entry suits kittens and older cats.</p></div></div>
          </div><div class="acc__item" >
            <button class="acc__head" type="button">How often do I actually empty it? <span class="pm">+</span></button>
            <div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner"><p>For one to two cats, about once a week. The app tells you before the drawer is full, so you're never surprised.</p></div></div>
          </div></div><div class="center mt-3"><a href="/pages/faq" class="tlink">See all FAQs <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

